{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <final id=\"a\">\n    <donedata>\n      <param name=\"both\" expr=\"1\" location=\"x\"/>\n      <param name=\"neither\"/>\n    </donedata>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":13,"byteOffset":162,"endColumn":47,"endLine":4,"startColumn":34,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"keep `expr` and remove `location`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":34,"endLine":4,"startColumn":26,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"param cannot use both `expr` and `location`\n\n**Note:** a parameter needs a name and exactly one value source: `expr` evaluates a value, `location` reads a data-model location\n\n**Help:** keep exactly one value source\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.7 <param>","text":"param cannot use both `expr` and `location`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":162,"start":154},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"conflicting attribute"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":4,"startColumn":35,"startLine":4}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML007"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":205,"endColumn":28,"endLine":5,"startColumn":28,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":" expr=\"…\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add an `expr` value source"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml007-param-value-source.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":13,"endLine":5,"startColumn":8,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"param requires exactly one of `expr` or `location`\n\n**Note:** a parameter needs a name and exactly one value source: `expr` evaluates a value, `location` reads a data-model location\n\n**Help:** use `expr` for a value expression or `location` for a data-model location\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.7 <param>","text":"param requires exactly one of `expr` or `location`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":190,"start":185},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML007"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a parameter needs a name and exactly one value source: `expr` evaluates a value, `location` reads a data-model location"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: give `<param>` a `name` and exactly one of `expr` or `location`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.7 <param>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML007` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#param","id":"SCXML007","name":"SCXML007","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<param>` lacks `name` or has zero or two value sources"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}